OL,3,ASix shot dead by gunmen at church
OL,4,Afuneral in Jordan, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people were killed when gunmen
OL,7,Fopened fire on a funeral in central
OL,8,FJordan, a government spokesperson has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAnother 28 people were injured in the
OL,12,Fchurch in the village of Hmoud, in the
OL,13,FKarak governorate on Friday.
OL,15,FThe unidentified gunmen are reported to
OL,16,Fhave arrived in a car, entered the
OL,17,Fchurch and opened fire before fleeing,
OL,18,Fin what government spokesperson Dr
OL,19,Fal-Momani Mohammad described as a
OL,20,F"heinous attack".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
